Systolic', max(bp.diastolic) 'Highest Diastolic',
min(bp.systolic) 'Lowest Systolic',
min(bp.diastolic) 'Lowest Diastolic', avg(bp.systolic) 'Average
Systolic', avg(bp.diastolic) 'Average Diastolic'
